[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_item_data")
item_name = "Research Map"
item_description = "A forest map with three marked locations. The nests must be documented."
item_type = 1
note_text = "[img]res://assets/Textures/forest_map.png[/img]

Three active hazel dormouse colonies, each in a hollow stump marked with the old survey's orange tape.

- Nest Alpha: east of the cabin
- Nest Beta: west of the cabin
- Nest Gamma: far to the south-west, by the sunken tunnel

Document all three nests, in that order, and log the data at the terminal."
scene_to_spawn = ExtResource("2_note_scene")
